#. module: account_credit_control_all_receivable
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_credit_control_all_receivable.field_credit_control_policy__all_receivable_accounts
msgid "Include all receivable accounts"
msgstr "Alle Forderungen-Konten einbeziehen"

#. module: account_credit_control_all_receivable
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_credit_control_all_receivable.field_credit_control_policy__all_receivable_accounts
msgid ""
"If set, the policy considers open items on every account of type Receivable "
"(e.g. individual debtor accounts). New accounts are included automatically, "
"the account list is ignored."
msgstr ""
"Wenn gesetzt, berücksichtigt die Regel offene Posten auf allen Konten vom "
"Typ Forderungen (z. B. einzelne Debitorenkonten). Neue Konten werden "
"automatisch einbezogen, die Kontenliste wird ignoriert."

#. module: account_credit_control_all_receivable
#: code:addons/account_credit_control_all_receivable/models/credit_control_policy.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Policy '%s': select at least one account or enable 'Include all receivable "
"accounts'."
msgstr ""
"Regel '%s': Bitte mindestens ein Konto auswählen oder 'Alle Forderungen-"
"Konten einbeziehen' aktivieren."
